    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011960/extras/5be42e59779d3a58d77727967b8fef2d.avif?t=1751032129\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Penny's little ones are lost deep in the mysterious forest, and it's up to you to bring them back home, safe and sound! <i>(Just make sure they're back before dinner!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the forest through all its seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through a forest that transforms with the changing seasons. Each bringing new visual beauty and new foes determined to stand in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Soar through the skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfold your trusty glider and take a leap of faith! Glide between mountains, over rivers, or just enjoy the thrill of flight. And don't worry, Penny's children have gliders too, so they won't get left behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover secrets and treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search high and low for hidden fruits, unlock magical gates with color-coded keys, and uncover the forest's many secrets. Challenge hostile creatures to steal the fruits they guard for yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the spirit realm to reveal hidden paths collectables.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011960/extras/5be42e59779d3a58d77727967b8fef2d.avif?t=1751032129\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Penny's little ones are lost deep in the mysterious forest, and it's up to you to bring them back home, safe and sound! <i>(Just make sure they're back before dinner!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the forest through all its seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through a forest that transforms with the changing seasons. Each bringing new visual beauty and new foes determined to stand in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Soar through the skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfold your trusty glider and take a leap of faith! Glide between mountains, over rivers, or just enjoy the thrill of flight. And don't worry, Penny's children have gliders too, so they won't get left behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover secrets and treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search high and low for hidden fruits, unlock magical gates with color-coded keys, and uncover the forest's many secrets. Challenge hostile creatures to steal the fruits they guard for yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the spirit realm to reveal hidden paths collectables.</p>",
